From 2005297fc4a265408e82b0f5df5d27ee8a9a4838 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:06:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] docs: document the gateway error envelope and its codes

List every error the gateway itself produces, with its status and
code, in the gateway README, and drop the note that the 502 and the
recovered 500 were plain text. Record the change in the CHANGELOG.

It is not marked breaking: no documented contract described the
plain-text bodies (the README only named the 429 with Retry-After and
the 500, and OpenAPI does not describe the gateway's 429, 500 or
502), and status codes and headers are unchanged. The entry tells
clients that read the text to read error.code instead. Also record
the panic log fix and update the gateway file and test counts in
module-mapping.
